    "emitted into portfolio/.../SynthesisPipeline/merchants.generated.ts by",
    "python -m glyphstudio.portfolio_wiring. Receipt keys in the dev table are",
    "NOT stable across re-OCR (the exporter checks the ReceiptPlace merchant",
